Meridian Trust Bank
Branch Staffing Realignment Note

Scope
- Temporary staffing shifts may occur when a branch has sustained incident pressure or service backlog.
- Staffing review should connect employee movement, branch operating pressure, and booked cost impact.

Working guidance
- Use main.hr_people.employee_changes for the canonical staffing movement record.
- Use main.ops_branch.branch_incidents for operational pressure in the same branch and period.
- Use main.finance_gl.gl_entries for booked branch impact tied to service recovery and overtime.

Review note
- Fee revenue can be useful as supporting finance context, but it is not a full substitute for booked ledger impact in the hard operational path.